Data
Ship, vehicle and item data comes from the Star Citizen Wiki API
(https://api.star-citizen.wiki), downloaded to your PC. Commodity prices, trade
routes and ships still in concept come from UEX Corp (https://uexcorp.space).
Web search answers can draw on starcitizen.tools (https://starcitizen.tools),
whose text is CC BY-SA 4.0, and on RSI's own sites.

